From: Thecatt6 <165608030+Thecatt6@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 15:32:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Fix HitSelect compile errors: use NamedChoice enums,
 simplify Mode

- Replace Mode objects with enum HitSelectMode/Preference implementing NamedChoice
- Use enumChoice with proper Tagged enum, fixes 'Tagged' errors
- Change mode.activeChoice -> mode == PAUSE/ACTIVE
- Simplify PauseTicks to top-level setting, fix en_us keys
- Make Addon.kt resilient to missing CommandExample

Co-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 src/main/kotlin/com/liquidaddon/Addon.kt      |  18 +-
 .../liquidaddon/modules/ModuleHitSelect.kt    | 170 ++++++------------
 .../resources/liquidaddon/lang/en_us.json     |   4 +-
 3 files changed, 69 insertions(+), 123 deletions(-)

